  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-07T19:23:37.528Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In SDK3 2021.03.22.18.27, SendCustomNetworkEvent was updated to work in editor, by bypassing the SendCustomNetworkEventHook. In doing this, it allowed networked events to work overall, but does not block events that begin with an underscore as the VRChat client does.\nPlease add an editor only implementation of SendCustomNetworkEventHook instead of removing the code that calls it. This way extensions like CyanEmu can also handle extra details.\nExample graph tested without CyanEmu:\napplication/vnd.unity.graphview.elements ",
